tility Meter Readings", "step_no": 3, "description": "Log baseline electricity and water meter indexes and initiate utility transfer."}, {"title": "Sign Handover Protocol & Mark CLOSED_WON", "step_no": 4, "description": "Countersign delivery protocol and upload; deal officially closes as CLOSED_WON."}]	تم تسليم الوحدة خالية من أي ملاحظات، وتم تسليم 4 نسخ مفاتيح وريموتات الكراج وقراءة عداد الكهرباء 14820 كيلوواط.	Handover protocol signed with zero caveats; delivered 4 key sets, garage remotes; electricity meter at 14820 kWh.
