amp."}, {"title": "Open Task Completion Modal", "step_no": 3, "description": "Select outcome: DEPOSIT_VERIFIED in Accounting task panel."}, {"title": "Confirm Reservation & Spawn Contract Task", "step_no": 4, "description": "Promotes reservation to CONFIRMED and routes deal to Legal for contract drafting."}]	تم تدقيق وقيد حوالة العربون بمبلغ 50,000 ر.س بمصرف الراجحي مرجع TXN-9847123، وتم إصدار سند قبض RV-2026-0004.	Reconciled earnest deposit of 50,000 SAR at Al Rajhi Bank ref TXN-9847123; issued receipt voucher RV-2026-0004.
