t-of-Way Audit", "step_no": 2, "description": "Ensure zero encroachments on municipal street setbacks or adjoining properties."}, {"title": "Flood & Drainage Assessment", "step_no": 3, "description": "Verify ground elevation, stormwater drainage, and absence of high water table issues."}, {"title": "Issue Survey Certification", "step_no": 4, "description": "Certify report via licensed surveying engineering office for transaction file."}]	تمت المطابقة المساحية: الأبعاد مطابقة للصك تماماً (الواجهة 35م والعمق 40م)، الارتدادات نظامية، ولا توجد أي تعديات مساحية.	Boundary survey completed: Dimensions strictly match deed (35m facade x 40m depth), setbacks fully compliant.
