n Compromise", "step_no": 3, "description": "Structure trade-offs (e.g. earlier closing date in exchange for price discount)."}, {"title": "Formalize Seller Approval", "step_no": 4, "description": "Update expected opportunity value in system and formally notify both parties."}]	تم التفاوض بين البائع والمشتري: خفض المالك السعر من 1,500,000 إلى 1,420,000 ريال مقابل التزام المشتري بسداد الدفعة كاملة خلال 14 يوماً.	Price negotiation concluded: Seller reduced asking price from 1.5M to 1.42M SAR in exchange for 14-day expedited closing.
